From: Yar1klamer
Subject: [PATCH] media: qcom: camss: add SM6115 support

SM6115 (bengal) carries the QCM2290 Spectra 340 camera subsystem with one
more instance of each block: three CSIPHYs, three CSID 340 and three TFEs
(stock DT: qcom,csiphy0-2, csid530/tfe530 0-2 at 0x5c6e000, 0x5c75000 and
0x5c7c000). Reuse the QCM2290 hardware ops and clock rates and describe
the third instance, needed for the front camera on CSIPHY2 of the Lenovo
Tab P11.
---
diff --git a/drivers/media/platform/qcom/camss/camss.c b/drivers/media/platform/qcom/camss/camss.c
index 2123f6388..5a739fc2c 100644
--- a/drivers/media/platform/qcom/camss/camss.c
+++ b/drivers/media/platform/qcom/camss/camss.c
@@ -820,6 +820,190 @@ static const struct resources_icc icc_res_2290[] = {
